Eze 11:1 , The presumption of the princes;
Eze 11:4 , Their sin and judgment;
Eze 11:13 , Ezekiel complaining, God shews him his purpose in saving a remnant;
Eze 11:21 , and punishing the wicked;
Eze 11:22 , The glory of God leaves the city;
Eze 11:24 , Ezekiel is returned to the captivity.
